NNAAMMEE
       pbmtocis - convert a PBM image to a CompuServe RLE image


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppbbmmttoocciiss [--ii] [--ww] [_c_i_s_f_i_l_e]


DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppbbmmttoocciiss reads a PBM image as input and produces a CompuServe RLE image
       as output.

       A CompuServe RLE image can be either 128 x 96 pixels or 256 x 192  pix‐
       els.   Anything  in excess on the right or bottom is cropped.  If width
       or height is insufficient, padding is added on  the  right  or  bottom.
       For better control of the size adjustment use ppaammccuutt or ppnnmmppaadd.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       In  addition  to  the options common to all programs based on libnetpbm
       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common Options ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ ), ppbbmmttoocciiss  recognizes  the
       following command line options:



       --ii     Inverse:   Reverse   the  mapping  of  foreground/background  to
              black/white.


       --ww     If the input image is smaller than the fixed size of the  output
              image, pad with white pixels rather than black.




